sequenceDiagram

    actor Custodian as Manager / Custodian
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Reconciliation API (/api/reconciliations)
    participant Service as Reconciliation Service (IReconciliationService)
    participant DB as SQL Server 2022
    participant Audit as Audit Service

    Custodian->>Client: Open End-of-Day Reconciliation Workspace
    Client->>API: GET /api/reconciliations/daily-summary
    API->>Service: Get daily advances, approved expenses & cash returns
    Service->>DB: Query active advances, expenses & cash return logs
    DB-->>Service: Daily financial summary payload
    Service->>Service: Compute Expected Vault Balance (Opening Float - Advances + Cash Returns)
    Service-->>API: EOD Reconciliation payload
    API-->>Client: Render EOD Reconciliation Workspace with pre-calculated metrics

    Custodian->>Client: Enter physical vault cash count & submit EOD settlement
    Client->>API: POST /api/reconciliations/settle-daily
    API->>Service: Finalize EOD Batch Settlement (ACID DB Transaction)
    Service->>DB: Begin DB Transaction
    Service->>DB: Insert RECONCILIATION record & CASH_RETURN logs
    Service->>DB: Update status of daily advances to SETTLED / CLOSED
    Service->>Audit: Record immutable EOD closure & audit log event
    Service->>DB: Commit DB Transaction
    DB-->>Service: Transaction committed successfully

    Service-->>API: EOD Reconciliation finalized
    API-->>Client: Display Daily Petty Cash Return Voucher (PCRV) & settlement confirmation